    <p>
      Discord: <strong>nova_store_168</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; 
      WhatsApp: <strong>+852 46727504 </strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; 
      <a href="#" class="highlight-link">DM for cooperation</a>
    </p>
  </div>
